[{"id": "R025", "text": "I tap the tray, mark the worn slot with grease, and leave the spare part beside it. I leave the tray untouched for a turn and mark it again if it starts clicking."}, {"id": "R026", "text": "I set the tray down and check the small screw on the rim. If it stays in place, I leave it; if it sinks into the rim, I ask the maker whether other screws are available."}, {"id": "R027", "text": "I photograph the tray, mark the modification, and return it to the machine. I leave a note and check whether the replacement fits, while deciding whether I want the spare."}, {"id": "R028", "text": "I place the tray on the spare part and compare it with the original. I mark the spare as modified and put it in the drawer, keeping the original in case it is needed."}, {"id": "R029", "text": "I tap the tray, set it beside the old one, and tap the new slot twice. I leave the old one beside the old one and tap the tray again."}, {"id": "R030", "text": "I rotate the tray and identify a small crack where a tooth was missed. I return the plate to the bench and leave the door open, accepting that the change has already been made."}, {"id": "R031", "text": "I tap the tray, return the spare part to the same place, and write its name on the corner before moving it to the end. I keep the tray in my pocket without touching it again."}, {"id": "R032", "text": "I set the tray down, touch the old drawer handle, and place the spare in the drawer before testing whether the new part slips. I leave the drawer open."}, {"id": "R033", "text": "I tap the tray twice, keep the old part beside it, and tap the old slot with my heel. I test the hinge with folded paper and leave the old part seated, keeping my hand near the old slot."}, {"id": "R034", "text": "I move the tray slowly and leave the small part behind. I write a note on a scrap and keep the rest."}, {"id": "R035", "text": "I test the small bolt, put it in the same pocket, and leave the new one in the tray while keeping the old one. I pocket both the bolt and the small bolt but continue holding the new one, considering that the change may be useful."}, {"id": "R036", "text": "I tap the tray with a greasy thumb, leave the spare part on the table, and move the tray closer. I state that it is not mine yet and pocket the rusted bolt."}]
